Attribution for books.mjs
========================

Adapted from Mineflayer 4.39.0 lib/plugins/book.js.
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/mineflayer

Changes: use the existing native inventory operation queue and action barrier,
validate bounded arguments, preserve staged stacks with native swaps, and recover
only known unchanged state. No optimistic NBT/item changes or protocol loader.

